+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. A missing or unknown key is 401
+(`unauthorized`); a known key without permission is 403 (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: GET requests only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
